        "name": "char_102_texas_1"
    },
    {
        "id": 57,
        "raw": "[name=\"Texas\"]   Let's not be too hard on the kid who shook off a crew of armed mobsters on a bicycle.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Texas",
        "content": "Let's not be too hard on the kid who shook off a crew of armed mobsters on a bicycle."
    },
    {
        "id": 58,
        "raw": "[name=\"Texas\"]   ...No, it's an ambush. Exusiai!",
