    },
    {
        "id": 86,
        "raw": "[name=\"Gambino\"]   Good evening, Penguin Logistics. I am Gambino Ricci, head of the Family.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Gambino",
        "content": "Good evening, Penguin Logistics. I am Gambino Ricci, head of the Family."
    },
    {
        "id": 87,
        "raw": "[name=\"Gambino\"]   And it looks like I've got a hostage.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Gambino",
        "content": "And it looks like I've got a hostage."
    },
    {
        "id": 88,
        "raw": "[name=\"Gambino\"]   But you ain't gonna make a scene over a little thing like this, eh?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Gambino",
        "content": "But you ain't gonna make a scene over a little thing like this, eh?"
    },
    {
        "id": 89,
